  <FLAVOURTEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="en-US"><![CDATA[The locks on the cages of the damned are opened with keys of marrow, sinew, and blood.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="fr-FR"><![CDATA[Les verrous des cages des damnés sont ouverts grâce à des clés de moelle, de tendons et de sang.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="es-ES"><![CDATA[Las cerraduras de las celdas de los condenados se abren con llaves de médula, tendones y sangre.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="de-DE"><![CDATA[Die Schlösser an den Käfigen der Verdammten werden mit Schlüsseln aus Mark, Sehnen und Blut geöffnet.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="it-IT"><![CDATA[Le serrature sulle gabbie dei dannati vengono aperte da chiavi di midollo, tendini e sangue.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="jp-JA"><![CDATA[呪われし者の牢獄の錠は、髄と腱と血の鍵で開かれる。]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="ko-KR"><![CDATA[저주받은 철창을 여는 열쇠는 골수, 힘줄, 피이다.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="ru-RU"><![CDATA[Замки на клетках обреченных открываются ключами из костей, жил и крови.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="pt-BR"><![CDATA[As fechaduras das jaulas dos malditos são abertas com chaves feitas de medula, nervos e sangue.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="zh-CN"><![CDATA[受诅者囚笼的锁，要用骨头，肌腱，与鲜血打造的钥匙开启。]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="zh-HK"><![CDATA[受詛者囚籠的鎖，要用骨頭，肌腱，與鮮血打造的鑰匙開啟。]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
  </FLAVOURTEXT>
